WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:24.000
Depreciation. Notice what changes and what stays the same.

00:00:24.000 --> 00:00:31.000
LEARNING TARGET: Distinguish accounting allocation from resale value

00:00:31.000 --> 00:00:38.000
THE BIG IDEA: Depreciation allocates an asset’s cost under an accounting method; it is not the same as a quote or resale price.

00:00:38.000 --> 00:00:45.000
WORKED EXAMPLE: A $1,000 depreciable basis over 5 equal years is $200/year under straight-line assumptions, before tax rules.

00:00:45.000 --> 00:00:52.000
PAUSE AND PREDICT: Scenario comparison

00:00:52.000 --> 00:00:59.000
MODEL LIMIT: Teaching relationships only—not live quotes, prices, tax advice or forecasts.

00:00:59.000 --> 00:01:06.000
TAKEAWAY: Distinguish accounting allocation from resale value
